 106 07fb 35303022 		.ascii	"500\">\011  \015\012\011  <h1>lwIP - A Lightweight "
 106      3E092020 
 106      0D0A0920 
 106      203C6831 
 106      3E6C7749 
 107 0821 5443502F 		.ascii	"TCP/IP Stack</h1>\015\012\011  <p>\015\012\011    T"
 107      49502053 
 107      7461636B 
 107      3C2F6831 
 107      3E0D0A09 
 108 0842 68652077 		.ascii	"he web page you are watching was served by a simple"
 108      65622070 
 108      61676520 
 108      796F7520 
 108      61726520 
 109 0875 20776562 		.ascii	" web\015\012\011    server running on top of the li"
 109      0D0A0920 
 109      20202073 
 109      65727665 
 109      72207275 
 110 089f 67687477 		.ascii	"ghtweight TCP/IP stack <a\015\012\011    href=\"htt"
 110      65696768 
 110      74205443 
 110      502F4950 
 110      20737461 
 111 08c8 703A2F2F 		.ascii	"p://www.sics.se/~adam/lwip/\">lwIP</a>.\015\012\011"
 111      7777772E 
 111      73696373 
 111      2E73652F 
 111      7E616461 
 112 08f1 20203C2F 		.ascii	"  </p>\015\012\011  <p>\015\012\011    lwIP is an o"
 112      703E0D0A 
 112      0920203C 
 112      703E0D0A 
 112      09202020 
 113 0912 70656E20 		.ascii	"pen source implementation of the TCP/IP\015\012\011"
 113      736F7572 
 113      63652069 
 113      6D706C65 
 113      6D656E74 
 114 093c 20202020 		.ascii	"    protocol suite that was originally written by <"
 114      70726F74 
 114      6F636F6C 
 114      20737569 
 114      74652074 
 115 096f 610D0A09 		.ascii	"a\015\012\011    href=\"http://www.sics.se/~adam/lw"
 115      20202020 
 115      68726566 
 115      3D226874 
 115      74703A2F 
 116 0998 69702F22 		.ascii	"ip/\">Adam Dunkels\015\012\011    of the Swedish In"
 116      3E416461 
 116      6D204475 
 116      6E6B656C 
 116      730D0A09 
 117 09c1 73746974 		.ascii	"stitute of Computer Science</a> but now is\015\012\011"
 117      75746520 
 117      6F662043 
 117      6F6D7075 
 117      74657220 
 118 09ee 20202020 		.ascii	"    being actively developed by a team of developer"
 118      6265696E 
 118      67206163 
 118      74697665 
 118      6C792064 
 119 0a21 730D0A09 		.ascii	"s\015\012\011    distributed world-wide. Since it's"
 119      20202020 
 119      64697374 
 119      72696275 
 119      74656420 
 120 0a4b 2072656C 		.ascii	" release, lwIP has\015\012\011    spurred a lot of "
 120      65617365 
 120      2C206C77 
 120      49502068 
 120      61730D0A 
 121 0a75 696E7465 		.ascii	"interest and has been ported to several\015\012\011"
 121      72657374 
 121      20616E64 
 121      20686173 
 121      20626565 
 122 0a9f 20202020 		.ascii	"    platforms and operating systems. lwIP can be us"
 122      706C6174 
 122      666F726D 
 122      7320616E 
 122      64206F70 
 123 0ad2 65642065 		.ascii	"ed either\015\012\011    with or without an underly"
 123      69746865 
 123      720D0A09 
 123      20202020 
 123      77697468 
 124 0afc 696E6720 		.ascii	"ing OS.\015\012\011  </p>\015\012\011  <p>\015\012\011"
 124      4F532E0D 
 124      0A092020 
 124      3C2F703E 
 124      0D0A0920 
 125 0b17 20202020 		.ascii	"    The focus of the lwIP TCP/IP implementation is "
 125      54686520 
 125      666F6375 
 125      73206F66 
 125      20746865 
 126 0b4a 746F2072 		.ascii	"to reduce\015\012\011    the RAM usage while still "
 126      65647563 
 126      650D0A09 
 126      20202020 
 126      74686520 
 127 0b74 68617669 		.ascii	"having a full scale TCP. This\015\012\011    makes "
 127      6E672061 
 127      2066756C 
 127      6C207363 
 127      616C6520 
 128 0b9e 6C774950 		.ascii	"lwIP suitable for use in embedded systems with tens"
 128      20737569 
 128      7461626C 
 128      6520666F 
 128      72207573 
 129 0bd1 0D0A0920 		.ascii	"\015\012\011    of kilobytes of free RAM and room f"
 129      2020206F 
 129      66206B69 
 129      6C6F6279 
 129      74657320 
 130 0bfb 6F722061 		.ascii	"or around 40 kilobytes\015\012\011    of code ROM.\015"
 130      726F756E 
 130      64203430 
 130      206B696C 
 130      6F627974 
